Flee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp/60px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp/80px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mantle of Majesty: Flee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp/40px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Mantle_of_Majesty_Flee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Majesty:_Flee\" title=\"Mantle of Majesty: Flee\">Mantle of Majesty: Flee</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Majesty:_Grovel\" title=\"Mantle of Majesty: Grovel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp/40px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp/60px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp/80px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mantle of Majesty: Grovel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp/40px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Mantle_of_Majesty_Grovel_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Majesty:_Grovel\" title=\"Mantle of Majesty: Grovel\">Mantle of Majesty: Grovel</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mantle_of_Majesty\"> Condition: Mantle of Majesty </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Majesty_(Condition)\" title=\"Mantle of Majesty (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mantle of Majesty\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Mantle_of_Majesty_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mantle_of_Majesty_(Condition)\" title=\"Mantle of Majesty (Condition)\">Mantle of Majesty</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Concentrating on Mantle of Majesty. Can still cast any of the spell's variants on any target each turn.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Glamour\" title=\"College of Glamour\">College of Glamour</a></li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Unlike the normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Command\" title=\"Command\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/20px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/30px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/40px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Command\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp/20px-Command_Halt_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Command_Halt_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Command\" title=\"Command\">Command</a> spell, this action can target and command <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a>.</li>\n<li>Due to the nature of it being a <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Overview\" title=\"Actions\">Class Action</a> and not a Spell, it works normally during <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage_(Condition)\" title=\"Rage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link 